# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# KERYX — local environment
#
# The desktop app needs no configuration. This is only for the one-off import
# of the old Base44 data into the local store (npm run db:import). Copy to
# `.env` and fill in; `.env` is gitignored, never commit real values.
#
#   BASE44_APP_ID         the old app's id
#   BASE44_ACCESS_TOKEN   a logged-in Base44 session token
#
# The web build on Supabase was retired (phase 8); supabase/ keeps its
# migrations and functions for a future cloud sync or backup.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
